        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 40 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short linear narrative adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From hunger, the world began to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole story started with a mushroom—strange, silent, and wrong. The moment Lin Meizhen ate it, her entire world began to twist into something unrecognizable—doors emerge where none should be; familiar things wear unfamiliar skins; shadows in the walls begin to breathe...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a house where reality warps and shadows whisper, can she uncover the truth before the fog consumes her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use specific items to shift between overlapping realities. Navigate a dual world to uncover puzzle clues, unlock new areas, and piece together the truth about yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >u Shift between mirrored realities to uncover hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >u Solve puzzles, each a thread woven into the fabric of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >u Survive with only your instincts and the safety of a quiet hiding place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >u Immerse yourself in an emotional narrative, where warmth and hope flicker even in the darkest corners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Profile</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lin Meizhen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 17</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high school student with a deep love for literature and art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently on leave of absence for unknown reasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lin Meizhen, a high school student who eats a suspicious mushroom at home—only to find her world twisting and distorting. A missing door? A strange room? Mushrooms appearing out of nowhere? When everyday objects reveal a hidden side, the truth may lie at the edge of hallucination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638910/extras/6205b0a08812f88b64113df93b84e4c9.avif?t=1752484879\" width=404 height=566 /></span></p>",
